# Development process

Before implementing functionality:

1. Read applicable requirements in `/docs` and `PRODUCTION_READINESS.md`
2. Search the existing implementation (models, APIs, services, UI)
3. Identify dependencies
4. Create an implementation plan
5. Implement database changes (Alembic)
6. Implement domain/business logic
7. Implement APIs
8. Implement authorization
9. Implement frontend
10. Add validation
11. Add error handling
12. Add automated tests
13. Run tests
14. Verify acceptance criteria

Never duplicate existing models, APIs, services, or components without checking the repository first.

Prefer extending proven patterns (e.g. FX provider → bank connectors; TOTP → WebAuthn) over parallel stacks.
